OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 26 NOV
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GRosie Turton is back with another
OL,12,     Grecord from her collection, and
OL,13,     Gtonight she chooses an album by a
OL,14,     Gpioneering free jazz double
OL,15,     Gbassist.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GThe Santa Cecilia Orchestra and
OL,18,     GChorus perform Bach's magnificent
OL,19,     GMass in B minor at the
OL,20,     GAuditorium, Parco della Musica in
OL,21,     GRome.
